# Evidence bytes are load-bearing in this repository: MANIFEST.sha256, the
# provenance.json files and verify_paper_claims.py all re-derive sha256 over file
# *content*. With core.autocrlf=true and no attributes, a fresh Windows checkout
# rewrites LF to CRLF and every one of those hashes silently stops matching, while
# the files still look identical in an editor. -text pins the bytes as committed.
results/** -text
.tmp/** -text
